# Generated show exports (Studio writes CSV/JSON/KML here).
# NOTE: scoped to this directory on purpose. The old taramandal-studio repo
# used a bare `*.json`, which silently untracked frontend/package.json and
# package-lock.json — a fresh clone could not npm install. Do not reintroduce it.
/exports/

